                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "There. That is a Borealis Gemstone, Urville's greatest secret. As far as we know, this is the only place in the Spiral where you can find them.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_Prisoner_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Cesar_POL_36.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1346306,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-MINE-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "There are other precious gems here, but the Borealis Gems are magical. We've never understood their powers, only that they were sacred.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_Prisoner_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Cesar_POL_37.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1346306,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-MINE-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "We did not touch them, until Rasputin forced us to start mining them. My father predicted that he would pay for it. I hope that proves true.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_Prisoner_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Cesar_POL_38.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1346306,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
